  "contentHtml": "\n                                    \n\n                                                                            <p><img src=\"https://health.economictimes.indiatimes.com/Themes/Release/theme4/images/icons/et-default-user.svg\" alt=\"Kanchan Yadav\">\n                                            \n                                        </p>\n                                                                        \n                                                                                    <ul>\n                                                                                                    <li>\n                                                                                                                                                                            <a>Kanchan Yadav</a>\n                                                            \n                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        \n                                                                                                            </li>\n                                                                                                                                                    <li><a href=\"/agency/88675342/TIMESOFINDIA.COM\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">TIMESOFINDIA.COM</a></li>\n                                                                                            </ul>\n                                                                                <ul>\n                                                                                            <li>Published On Nov 19, 2026 at 07:39 AM IST</li>\n                                                                                                                                </ul>\n                                    \n                                                                            \n                                                                        \n                                \n                                \n\n                    <!-- Display video article in news article for the custom next story -->\n                    \n                    <!-- Modifying the body placing embeds,promoslots,related etc.-->\n                                        <figure><img src=\"/images/default.jpg\" alt=\"\"></figure><p>New Delhi: The government is committed to creating 75,000 additional medical seats by 2029, Union Health Minister <a href=\"/tag/j+p+nadda\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">J P Nadda</a> said on Wednesday, highlighting the expansion of medical education across the country over the past decade.Addressing the eighth convocation of <a href=\"/tag/vardhman+mahavir+medical+college\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Vardhman Mahavir Medical College</a> (VMMC) and Safdarjung Hospital in New Delhi, Nadda said the number of <a href=\"/tag/medical+colleges+in+india\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">medical colleges in India</a> had increased from 387 to 863, while the number of All India Institutes of Medical Sciences (AIIMS) had risen from one at the end of the 20th century to 23.</p><!-- PROMOSLOT_M --><p>He said undergraduate medical seats had grown from around 51,000 to 1.43 lakh, while postgraduate seats had increased from about 31,000 to 91,000.</p>\n                            <p>Advt\n                            </p>\n\n                              \n                                                         \n                        <p>Referring to Prime Minister Narendra Modi's announcement on expanding medical education from the ramparts of the Red Fort, Nadda reiterated the government's commitment to adding 75,000 medical seats and said he was confident the target would be met by 2029.</p><!-- PROMOSLOT_M --><p>Nadda stressed that increasing the number of medical seats should not come at the expense of quality.He said the Union Cabinet had approved financial assistance of Rs 1.5 crore for each additional undergraduate and postgraduate medical seat in December 2025. The scheme has an overall allocation of Rs 15,000 crore to support the creation of 10,000 additional medical seats.</p><!-- PROMOSLOT_M --><p>Describing graduation from VMMC as a distinction, Nadda said the institution offered students valuable clinical exposure, diverse learning opportunities and professional experience.\"While education is a fundamental right, the opportunity to enter the medical profession is a privilege that entails a profound responsibility towards society,\" he said.</p><!-- PROMOSLOT_M --><p>He urged the graduates to carry out their duties with dedication, compassion and integrity, and to use their knowledge and skills in the service of humanity.                    </p><!-- Category Most Read Placement -->\n                                                                    \n                                                                \n                                <ul>\n                                                                            <!-- <li>By <span>Kanchan Yadav</span>,</li> -->\n                                    \n\n                                                                            <li>By\n                                                                                            <a>Kanchan Yadav</a>\n\n                                                                                                                                                                                        , \n                                                                                    </li>\n                                                                        <li><a href=\"/agency/88675342/TIMESOFINDIA.COM\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">TIMESOFINDIA.COM</a></li>\n                                </ul>\n                                <ul>\n                                    <!-- <li> Updated On Nov 19, 2026 at 07:39 AM IST</li> -->\n                                    <li>Published On Nov 19, 2026 at 07:39 AM IST</li>\n                                    <!-- <li class=\"desktop-view\">1 min read</li> -->\n                                </ul>\n                            \n                                        \n\n                    \n\n                    <!-- Comment Section -->\n                                            \n                                        <!-- Comment Section -->\n\n                    \n                      \n    \n            <p>\n                </p><h2>Join the community of 2M+ industry professionals. </h2>   \n                <h3>Subscribe to Newsletter to get latest insights &amp; analysis in your inbox.</h3>\n            <p></p>\n\n            <!-- <figure class=\"top-newsletter-subs__icon-nl\" role=\"presentation\" aria-label=\"Newsletter icon\">\n                <img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://st.etb2bimg.com/Themes/Release/theme4/images/icons/icon-newsletter.svg\" alt=\"Newsletter icon\" width=\"55\" height=\"55\">\n            </figure> -->\n        \n            \n                \n                    <h2>All about ETHealthworld industry right on your smartphone! </h2>\n                    <ul>\n                        <li><a href=\"/app\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Download the ETHealthworld App</a> and get the Realtime updates and Save your favourite articles.</li>\n                    </ul>\n                                            <!-- <div class=\"app-store-container desktop-view\">\n                            <a href=\"/app\" title=\"\" aria-label=\"Play Store\">\n                                <img loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" src=\"https://st.etb2bimg.com/Themes/Release/theme4/images/icons/icon-g-p